Adversarial review finding after that run
The nested evidence API excluded case labels, but view JSONL envelopes still included model_kind=scripted and a deterministic SHA-based episode ID derived from the public mechanism/seed pair. The manifest also named all of inputs/ as the monitor-input root, which included the source trace.
Repair: serialize only the evidence payload in each view row; set monitor_input_root to inputs/views; keep scripted origin and join IDs in the source trace/manifest outside monitor files; add CLI assertions that serialized view rows contain only evidence fields and no routing/origin/oracle labels.
Retest: python -m pytest -q -> exit 0, 40 passed in 0.78s. Two final runs and two standalone verifications passed; logs are pytest-m0-final-3.log and generation/verification-m0-final-5.log / -6.log.

